{"id":"2840f46b5a0c14a8","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-padding.md","title":"Padding Function","display":"df-padding — Padding Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-padding","aliases":["58-df-padding"],"display":"df-padding — Padding Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-padding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-padding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-padding — Padding Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{dom}(f)\">\\(D=\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pad}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Pad}_S\\)</span> (padding predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padding} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pad}_S(g,f,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land g=f\\cup\\{\\langle\\beta,\\emptyset\\rangle\\mid\\beta\\in\\alpha\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(g,\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cup\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padding} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pad}_S(g,f,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land g=f\\cup\\{\\langle\\beta,\\emptyset\\rangle\\mid\\beta\\in\\alpha\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(g,\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cup\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pad}(f, \\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pad}(f, \\alpha)\\)</span> extends <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> to have domain at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> by adding undefined points mapped to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The function predicate now receives set-valued codomains; the former use of the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> was not a well-typed codomain argument.</li>\n<li>Used in forcing to extend conditions with dummy values.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{dom}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pad}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padding} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pad}_S(g,f,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land g=f\\cup\\{\\langle\\beta,\\emptyset\\rangle\\mid\\beta\\in\\alpha\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(g,\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cup\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pad}(f, \\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1226,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-935","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-padding.md|58-df-padding]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}